{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19974","headline":"与王二十一员外涯游昭成寺 · 孟郊","name":"与王二十一员外涯游昭成寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛友寂寂约，省骑霏霏尘。\n游僧步晚磬，话茗含芳春。\n瑶策冰入手，粉壁画莹神。\n頳廊芙蓉霁，碧殿瑠璃匀。\n玄讲岛岳尽，渊咏文字新。\n屡笑寒竹讌，况接青云宾。\n顾慙余眷下，衰瘵婴残身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19974.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19974","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}